ios: host events (ingame, menu-open, menu-close)

Optional notifications for the host page through lcHost.onClientEvent(name, detail), checked once per
client cycle: 'ingame' (true/false on login/logout), 'menu-open' ({area, x, y, width, height,
options[] top to bottom as drawn, colour tags included}) and 'menu-close'. Lets the host drive
haptics, status reporting or a native menu picker without polling client internals.

